  for the rest of the day. Instructors scale every movement so you work at
  the right intensity for your level.\nHow do I Sign-up?\n\nRegistration i
 s not required.\nFREE for students with a valid Montclair State ID\n\nWhe
 re and When?\n\nWednesdays\, June 1st - June 25th\n12:00 pm - 12:30 pm\nS
 tudent Recreation Center - Multipurpose Room 1\n\nInstructor: Jeffrey\n\n
 \n\nHosted by: Campus Recreation\n\nAdditional Information can be found a
 t: https://montclair.campuslabs.com/engage/event/12476746
